```java
int sum = 0;
for (int i = 1; i <= 27; i++) {
    sum += i;
}
System.out.println(sum); // 378
```
Each loop adds the next number to `sum`.

```java
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        for (int i = 1; i <= 49; i++) {
            System.out.println(i);
        }
    }
}
```
The loop starts at 1 and stops after printing 49.

